cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this tool in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "RoB 2 Rocket"
abstract: >-
  A browser-based tool that performs a Cochrane RoB 2 risk-of-bias assessment
  for a single randomized-trial result, answering each signalling question with
  a stateless model call and computing domain and overall judgements from the
  official RoB 2 decision tables.
type: software
authors:
